PARTS OF A DATA
Table Number
Tables should be numbered so that they could be
used for easy reference. Integral numbers (such as 1,
2, 3) or subscribed numbers (such as 3.1, 2.4) etc.
Title of the Table
It is a brief explanation of the contents of a table. A
good title should be short, clear and complete in all
respects.
Next
