PARTS OF A DATA
Head Note
If the title does not provide complete information, a
head note supplements it by explaining the table or the parts of the table.
Column Heading or Caption
It is word or a phrase which explains the contents of
a column in a table.
Next
Toppers
प्रारंBATCH
PARTS OF A DATA
Stubs or Row Headings
Stubs are title of the rows of a table. These titles
indicate information contained in the row of the table.
The complete left column is called the stub column.
Body of the Table
Body of the table means sum total of the items in
the table. It indicates value of various items in the
table. Each item in the body is called 'cell'.
